    ## Problem

    EDF needed to estimate the remaining useful life of its fleet's drivetrains for its regulatory permit and maintenance plan.

    ## Solution

    Proof of concept with Weibull reliability models and trend regression, exposed through a fleet dashboard.

    ## Features

    - Fleet view with per-turbine traffic-light status
    - Health Index and PQ Index
    - Transparent confidence bands and β, η, R² metrics
    - Demo mode that works without a backend
